	<!--
	  Alternate app icons. Each key must match a pair of PNG files at the
	  bundle root named AppIcon-<Key>@2x.png (120x120) and @3x.png (180x180).
	  The files are not in the asset catalog — iOS reads alternate icons
	  directly from the bundle root. Ship placeholder PNGs or real key art;
	  the scaffolding is ready either way.
	-->
